The prototype still creates candidate resume links with a fifteen-minute lifetime. Because these links expose applicant documents outside the authenticated page request, Security wants a five-minute maximum.

The URL must be bound to one resume object and employer tenant. Please also confirm it is not written to analytics or support logs.

